    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899547305857024
    m_Localized: Buy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899800574709760
    m_Localized: 'Batlle rewards :'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899878995611648
    m_Localized: Close
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3899917964890112
    m_Localized: 'Item(s) found :'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 3914717289730048
    m_Localized: Heal 100 LP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803000768286720
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803074814529536
    m_Localized: Are you ready for your training ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803205932666880
    m_Localized: Yes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803246550306816
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6803377567780864
    m_Localized: All right. Today we are going to review the basics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6804222082502656
    m_Localized: The battle are turned based. Each players attack one after the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6804991338827776
    m_Localized: Let's begin with the attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805327965278208
    m_Localized: To attack, press "attack"  boutton.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805550217252864
    m_Localized: We are going to try that in a real fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805667733262336
    m_Localized: Are you ready ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805704215318528
    m_Localized: Yes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805730631045120
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805779431772160
    m_Localized: Well then, let's go !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6805947128434688
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806256617738240
    m_Localized: Good fight !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806531843772416
    m_Localized: But some ennemies are difficult to beat with simple attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806722323894272
    m_Localized: How to beat them then ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806781912371200
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6806857300791296
    m_Localized: In this case, you have to use magic..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987417142906880
    m_Localized: But, I can't use magic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987519660085248
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987547984220160
    m_Localized: Don(t worry. For the next fight, you will be join by Vard who can
      use magic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987719074074624
    m_Localized: Are you ready Vard ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987837915484160
    m_Localized: Yes, I will fight with Marco !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987920304197632
    m_Localized: Great !!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6987943981043712
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988117205798912
    m_Localized: All right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988171719168000
    m_Localized: To use magic, you need to press the "magic" button.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988368394276864
    m_Localized: Then choose the magic to use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988444520894464
    m_Localized: Unlike normal attack, magic or thechnique use your magic point or
      MP.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988743847399424
    m_Localized: The MP are limited, so remember to check your MP before a fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6988944817475584
    m_Localized: Are you ready ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989018809192448
    m_Localized: Yes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989068016766976
    m_Localized: I am ready !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989110274379776
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989207104081920
    m_Localized: All right then, let's go !!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989355263676416
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989392995635200
    m_Localized: We reviewed the basic fight move together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989561979949056
    m_Localized: I think you are ready for tomorrow exam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989832885850112
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6989915442335744
    m_Localized: I hope you are ready for your exam ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990026050326528
    m_Localized: Yes, we are ready !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990088067305472
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990125774098432
    m_Localized: All right ! I will be your examiner today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990756949741568
    m_Localized: You are going to fight with me. This way I will check your fighting
      skills.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6990968690790400
    m_Localized: If you beat me, your exam will be succeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991121417981952
    m_Localized: Prepare to fight !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991449114759168
    m_Localized: Nobody passes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991631285964800
    m_Localized: Nobody passes !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991678614491136
    m_Localized: Look everywhere !!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991766124449792
    m_Localized: If you have any information, you have to tell us !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6991982567313408
    m_Localized: Search in the houses !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992083008311296
    m_Localized: Nobody go outside !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992159663411200
    m_Localized: Nobody go outside !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992239799783424
    m_Localized: 'Nobody go outside ! '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992466388668416
    m_Localized: n-Woman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992520587464704
    m_Localized: Those creatures are dangerous. Let the soldat take care of them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992697838751744
    m_Localized: n-Woman
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992724699074560
    m_Localized: Oh my god, this is horrible !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6992928001183744
    m_Localized: n-Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993071744176128
    m_Localized: I hope they will catch those monster !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993207639625728
    m_Localized: n-Girl
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993243760971776
    m_Localized: I have never seen a metamorph in my life. People said they look
      like wild animals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993547646685184
    m_Localized: It was a good training session.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993633457950720
    m_Localized: I think you are ready for tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6993848281812992
    m_Localized: Let go to sleep. I'll will be good for us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994499996962816
    m_Localized: Dear residents !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994588119289856
    m_Localized: We are here beacause metamorphes have been seen nearby.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6994812103512064
    m_Localized: Those creatures are accused of the murder of the king of Moonshine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995081340080128
    m_Localized: If you have any information that can help us find them, you can
      came to us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995376098988032
    m_Localized: Be carefull, those creatures are dangerous. Don't go close to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995570635001856
    m_Localized: If you see them, call us immediatelly !
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6995703086927872
    m_Localized: We are going to search the houses and the forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6996024232202240
    m_Localized: I am warning you. If someone try to help those murderer, this person
      wil be arrest as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6996424029065216
    m_Localized: Stay here while we search the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6996552748060672
    m_Localized: I need to inform the other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997365151191040
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997402774097920
    m_Localized: It was a good fight..
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997524085952512
    m_Localized: You are ready to begin your training to become a knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997675223502848
    m_Localized: The path will be long, but I will help you as much as I can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997819796967424
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997876009029632
    m_Localized: What's next ?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997927162761216
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6997961023377408
    m_Localized: I wil be in charge of your mentor. I will teach you everything you
      need to know about the world and how to become a knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6998337554436096
    m_Localized: You will also be joined by Mok. He has passed his exam last year
      and will help you during the fights.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003142339383296
    m_Localized: I am happy to be with Mok.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003224174448640
    m_Localized: n-Knight
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003279413432320
    m_Localized: Now, I am going to talk about your missions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003436666277888
    m_Localized: Of course, we will be training your fighting skills. Because fighting
      will be a great part of your missions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003762173628416
    m_Localized: We need to be able to protect people against thief or monster.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7003953907847168
    m_Localized: We can encounter some outside the village, on the road or in the
      forest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004146065690624
    m_Localized: But some of the monster will be in the donjons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004357366337536
    m_Localized: However, donjons contains usefull resources for our development.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004573477851136
    m_Localized: That's why, during your training we will also go to donjons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7004906111324160
    m_Localized: But our role is not only to fight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005107609882624
    m_Localized: Our role is to assist peoples.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005214501720064
    m_Localized: That is why, we will begin by talking to people to see if someone
      need our help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005493905281024
    m_Localized: Now that I am with you, you can also get outside the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7005639418269696
    m_Localized: The neighbour village does not have knight post. We should also
      go see if they need help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7006113764691968
    m_Localized: Before leaving, you should go to the shop to buy new equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7006254550700032
    m_Localized: I can't wait to begin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7006332875132928
    m_Localized: With you, I feel safe. And if we are hurt, we could always go see
      Rose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7144238583336960
    m_Localized: Welcome to Medieville
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7148466575986688
    m_Localized: Wasp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
